* Current-mirror loaded single-stage CMOS amplifier
* Generic 180 nm Level-1 hand design
* Target: |Av| > 25 dB, current-mirror mismatch < 5%

VDD vdd 0 1.8
IREF nref 0 20u

* PMOS diode-connected reference
M2 nref nref vdd vdd PMOD W=24u L=1.5u

* PMOS current-mirror load
M3 vout nref vdd vdd PMOD W=24u L=1.5u

* NMOS common-source input device
M1 vout vin 0 0 NMOD W=6u L=1u

* DC bias and AC small-signal excitation
VIN vin 0 0.602 AC 1

.model NMOD NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=0.45 KP=270u LAMBDA=0.08 GAMMA=0.4 PHI=0.7)
.model PMOD PMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.45 KP=70u LAMBDA=0.04 GAMMA=0.4 PHI=0.7)

.op
.dc VIN 0.4 0.9 2m
.ac dec 20 1 10Meg
.meas AC gain_db FIND vdb(vout) AT=10

.backanno
.end
